      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4267,
      "text": "Man never tires of asking for good, but if evil touches him, he is desperate and despondent.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 482,
      "ruku": 418,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4268,
      "text": "But if We give him a taste of mercy from Us after being inflicted with adversity, he will surely say, “This is my due[21], and I do not think that the Hour will ever come, but if I am brought back to my Lord, I will surely have with Him the best [reward].” We will surely inform the disbelievers of what they did, and We will surely make them taste a harsh punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 482,
      "ruku": 418,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4269,
      "text": "When We bestow favor upon man, he turns away and distances himself [from Us]; but when evil touches him, he is full of prolonged supplication.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
