      "page": 482,
      "ruku": 418,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4271,
      "text": "We will show them Our signs in the universe and in their own selves until it becomes clear to them that this [Qur’an] is the truth[22]. Is it not enough that your Lord is a Witness over all things?",
      "surah": {
